Upstream state
--------------
The copy corresponds approximately to upstream commit
a0009ed9a208ff9864a5c1368c04c273bb20dd06 (early 2022).

Why the fork is required
------------------------
DuSkill chains several Meta-World skills into a single long-horizon episode in
scenes that contain four manipulable objects at once. Upstream Meta-World
cannot express this, so `pip install metaworld` will NOT work; install this
directory instead:

    pip install -e duskill/envs/metaworld

Modifications made for DuSkill
------------------------------
Code
  * metaworld/envs/mujoco/mujoco_env.py
      `max_path_length` raised from 500 to 2000.
  * metaworld/envs/mujoco/sawyer_xyz/sawyer_xyz_env.py
      `max_path_length` raised from 500 to 3000.
  * metaworld/policies/policy.py
      Added the `move_u` (unit-vector move scaled by a speed parameter) and
      `move_acc` (velocity error / acceleration) hooks used by the DuSkill
      scripted experts in duskill/envs/metaworld_complex/policies.
  * metaworld/policies/sawyer_plate_slide_side_v2_policy.py
      Four debug `print` statements commented out.

Assets (all under metaworld/envs/assets_v2/)
  * objects/assets/lever.xml
      `LeverAxis` hinge range widened from 0-1.57 to 0-1.9 rad.
  * scene/basic_scene.xml
      Table and retaining walls enlarged (table half-size .7 x .4 -> .9 x .5,
      walls moved out to match) so four objects fit in a single scene.
  * objects/assets/xyz_base.xml
      The `corner2` and `corner3` cameras were re-aimed for the wider scene.
  * scene/basic_scene_a.xml
      New scene variant.
  * sawyer_xyz/sawyer_multitask_*.xml
      32 new multi-object scenes (31 four-skill combinations plus
      `sawyer_multitask_test.xml`), together with
      `sawyer_xyz/sawyer_multi_stage_buttons.xml`.
  * objects/assets/{puck,drawer,coffeemachine}_noname.xml
      New object variants with the on-object name labels removed.
  * objects/assets/buttonbox_{L,R,FL,FR}.xml and buttonbox_dependencies.xml
      New button-box placements plus recolored button materials
      (`btn_green`, `btn_blue`, `btn_purple`).

Apart from the above (and whitespace / line-ending normalisation of many
assets_v2 XML files), the contents of this directory are unmodified upstream
Meta-World.
